{{ToonInfo|type=Main|Toon=Shelly|extra=Fossilian|Date=July 12, 2024|with={{CI|Flutter|name=true}}, {{CI|Teagan|name=true}}, and {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}|Pronoun=She}}

==Appearance==
Shelly is a beige {{wp|ammonite}} shell with a black opening seen on the left side of her head. She has orange blush and two bottom lashes underneath each eye. She wears a dark brown overall dress with a light brown sleeveless undershirt. When hurt, her eyes squint closed, and her smile turns into a grimace.

==Personality==
Shelly is a very extroverted [[Toon]], who enjoys talking about her interest in dinosaurs and other forms of prehistoric life, but she has other hobbies as well, such as sewing, which is shown in her dialogues with {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}, {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}, and {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}. She is always bursting with energy and tries her best to get along with others, even to the point of twisting cruelty towards her into awkward kindness; shown in her conversation with {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}. She is highly supportive and kind towards others, as hinted at through her Active Ability, possibly due to the influence of her [[Toon Handler]] or natural energy.

She's often surprised and even excited when other Toons show an interest in her, especially {{Type|Mains}}, demonstrated in her dialogues with {{CI|Astro|name=true}}, {{CI|Vee|name=true}}, {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}, {{CI|Rodger|name=true}}, and {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}, possibly because she often goes unnoticed or ignored by the others. For unknown reasons, Shelly is the most ignored Toon out of all the Main Characters, and this has been implied multiple times in the game and in her {{CI|Twisted Shelly}}[[Twisted Shelly|Twisted counterpart]]'s description. This seems to greatly upset her, but she does try to keep up her optimistic and positive facade despite this, instances of which are shown in her dialogues with {{CI|Teagan|name=true}} and {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}.

