==Trivia==
*Shelly's [[Toon Handler]] is {{CI|Shanon Mendez|name=true}}.
*Shelly's friends include {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}, {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}, {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}, and {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}. 
**Sprout's friendship with her is proven by the fact that she introduced Sprout to {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}}<ref>[[File:S1 Ep3 with better quality.png|200px]]</ref> as shown in a storyboard and has also talked to him about ancient plants a couple of times, and that she likes to clean fossils with Tisha and acts friendly towards her.
**Tisha and Yatta also seem to be one of the first [[Toons]] to know about her sewing hobby, with Yatta being enthusiastic at the idea of being taught how to sew by Shelly. 
**Bassie says in her [[Gossip]] about Shelly that they get along well, saying that she even wishes she was an [[Easter Toon]]. Furthermore, {{CI|Cocoa|name=true}} tells Shelly to keep hanging out with Bassie more.
*Shelly is a paleontologist, as she studies and preserves ancient remains rather than treating them as decorations as seen in [[Shelly's Floor|her map]], which is filled with dinosaur and ancient fossils, and also the animation on the TV in the same map, which shows her cleaning a fossil.
*Shelly and {{CI|Vee|name=true}} have a focus episode together advertised in a [[Poster]] called Future and Past, where Shelly represents the past and Vee represents the future.
*Shelly's designation is M-004 with the '''M''' standing most likely for {{Type|Main}}.
*Shelly's name is most likely derived from the word "shell" since she is an ammonite, an extinct species of {{wp|cephalopods}} that lived in a shell.
*Shelly, alongside {{CI|Gigi|name=true}}, {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}, {{CI|Soulvester|name=true}}, {{CI|Waxwell|name=true}}, {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}, and {{CI|Dyle|name=true}} (the latter two being unplayable developer [[Toons]]) currently have the largest Skill Checks in the game, being 5{{Star}} (Skill Check size: 250, Skill Check value: 3.00, Skill Check chance: 25%, and Skill Check speed: 5).
**She is the only publicly playable [[Toon]] without 1 Star Stamina.
*Shelly's full name was revealed by [[Qwelver]] when she was doing a livestream on Discord.
*Shelly is ignored by most [[Toons]] such as {{CI|Looey|name=true}} (in their dialogues).
**In the [[Gift Shop]] [[Floor]], none of Shelly's plushies were sold besides three, compared to the rest of the {{Type|Main}} Toon plushies, implying she is unpopular among children too.
**This may be a subversion of expectations, as dinosaurs are a common interest among children in the real world.
*{{Citation|Shelly cannot do a handstand, confirmed by [[Qwel]] in a 10/17/2024 QnA stream.}}
*Shelly is one of the [[Toons]] that has an official [[merchandise]] plush as of now, with the others being [[Astro]], [[Bassie]], [[Bobette]], {{CI|Boxten|name=true}}, [[Cocoa]], [[Dandy]], [[Gourdy]], [[Pebble]], {{CI|Poppy|name=true}}, [[Sprout]], and [[Vee]].
*Shelly is learning how to sew from a friend, as stated in her dialogues with [[Sprout]] and {{CI|Bobette|name=true}}, whose name isn't stated.
**This is further proved according to a conversation with [[Yatta]] in which she mentions how [[Tisha]] said Shelly could sew.
*Shelly shares quite similar stats with [[Gigi]] and {{CI|Finn|name=true}}, having 1 extra Star on Stamina compared to Gigi and 1 extra Star on Skill Check compared to Finn.
*Shelly is the second [[Main Character]] [[Toon]] to have her [[Shelly's Floor|own Floor]], the first one being [[Astro]] with [[Astro's Floor|his Floor]], the third being [[Vee]] with [[Vee's Floor|her Floor]], and the fourth being [[Sprout]] with [[Sprout's Floor|his Floor]].
*Shelly's favorite dinosaur changes every week.<ref>https://discord.com/channels/969934252844138496/969934252844138499/1348673720989913191</ref>
*Shelly is the first female [[Toon]] to appear on the game icon, and the first Toon in general to appear alongside [[Dandy]] on it.
*Shelly's Stats are the first appearance of 5 Star Skill Check and 2 Star Stamina.
**[[Tisha]], who was released with her, also had the first appearance of 2 Star Stamina.
***Technically, [[Vee]] originally had 2 Star Stamina, but it was increased to 3 Stars. Therefore, Shelly and Tisha are the first [[Toons]] to have consistent 2 Stars in Stamina, but not the first ones to have it.
***[[Dandy]] also always had 5 Star Skill Check, but because he is developer-exclusive, Shelly is the first Toon to have 5 Star Skill Check and be accessible to everyone.
*The sound used for Shelly's {{AI|Shelly|name=true}} [[Ability]] originates from the {{wp|Microsoft Windows 3.1}}'s startup sound or simply known as the 'Tada' sound.
**It is uploaded on the Roblox Audio Library as "[https://create.roblox.com/store/asset/12222253/victorywav victory.wav]".
*Shelly is the second shortest [[Main Character]] [[Toon]] and the third shortest overall, the shortest being [[Pebble]].
**She is actually a tad bit shorter than {{CI|Toodles|name=true}}, probably due to the flat nature of her head.
*Shelly is one of the last [[Main Characters]] to be optimized, along with [[Astro]].
**[[Pebble]] got his optimizations in [[Changelog|v0.7.1]], [[Vee]] got her optimizations in v0.9.1, [[Sprout]] got his optimizations in v0.11.1, and finally Shelly and Astro got theirs in v0.12.1.
*Shelly is one of the 3 [[Toons]] to have a [[Skin]] in the first [[Dandy's World]] [[Collab]], the [[2025 Care Bears Collab]], the others being [[Astro]] and {{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}}. This Skin will also never be unlockable again.
*Shelly's Cheer Bear [[Skin]] is one of the first 3 Skins to have official renders shown in-game.
*Shelly is the third [[Toon]] to have both their Toon and {{CI|Twisted Shelly}}[[Twisted Shelly|Twisted counterpart]] in a thumbnail, with the first being [[Razzle & Dazzle]] & {{CI|Blot|name=true}}, the second being [[Sprout]] & [[Pebble]], the fourth being [[Gourdy]], the fifth being {{CI|Coal|name=true}}, and the sixth being [[Bassie]].
**She is the only one to be wearing a [[Skin]].

